				<r3d:description language="eng">The Arctic and Antarctic Data Archive System (ADS) collects observation data and modeling products obtained by various Japanese research projects and gives researchers to access the results. By centrally managing a wide variety of Arctic and Antarctic observation data, we promote the use of data across multiple disciplines. Researchers use these integrated databases to clarify the mechanisms of environmental change in the atmosphere, ocean, land-surface and cryosphere. It is expected that ADS will provide an opportunity for collaboration between modelers and field scientists.</r3d:description>
